---
description: Lab Journal records - how entries, versions and signed records may change
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/lab-journal/**"
---

lab-journal:

- Follow the `lab-journal` skill for any wet-lab entry, plan, plasmid, calculation or the journal page.
- The journal changes only through `<home>/lj` commands: write drafts under `<home>/drafts/`, save with `lj save`.
- Never edit, move or delete files in `<home>/journal/` or `<home>/app/` by hand or with a script.
- A signed entry never changes; a correction is a new entry with `"amends"`.
- Every number comes from `lj` output; a calculation the journal lacks is "not in this journal yet", never your own.
- Never invent a value, lot, band or Ct: leave a field out when it was not given.
